OL,3,ARobert Pattinson to replace Daniel
OL,4,ACraig as James Bond
OL,5,
OL,6,FRobert Pattinson, the British actor
OL,7,Fknown for films such as Twilight and
OL,8,FThe Batman, has been confirmed as the
OL,9,Fnext actor to play James Bond.
OL,11,FThe announcement was made by Amazon MGM
OL,12,FStudios in a social media post on
OL,13,FMonday, with a picture showing
OL,14,FPattinson in character as 007.
OL,16,FThe 40-year-old becomes the seventh
OL,17,Factor to play the famous fictional spy
OL,18,Fand will star in the 26th Bond movie,
OL,19,Fdue to be released in 2028.
OL,23,APub: 16-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG10/19
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
