OL,3,ARobert Pattinson to replace Daniel
OL,4,ACraig as James Bond
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn a statement, the London-born actor
OL,7,Fsaid: "James Bond is one of the most
OL,8,Flegendary characters in cinema, and to
OL,9,Fbe entrusted with 007 is the honour of
OL,10,Fa lifetime."
OL,23,APub: 16-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG11/19
